        "id": "creative-space",
        "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: shared Solitude blog theme illustration. Style: premium layered paper-cut sculpture with tactile matte paper grain, crisp folded edges, soft realistic depth shadows. Palette: deep midnight navy, cream white, restrained coral orange accents. Inspired by the provided cover's layered paper landscape and the provided logo's friendly cream paper airplane. No text, no letters, no numbers, no watermark, no framework logos. These are style references, not edit targets. Primary request: a landscape about-page creative workspace illustration, 3:2 framing. A quiet paper-sculpture writing desk with a notebook, pencil, desk lamp and a cream folded paper airplane, against layered navy window scenery lit by a warm dawn. A coral notebook detail. Thoughtful cozy atmosphere. No people, no personal photographs, no readable writing or simulated text. Main desk arrangement centrally framed to remain recognizable when cropped to a square.",
        "transparent_background": false,
        "original": "docs/brand/originals/creative-space.png",
